{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792671162582,"sessionID":"ses_e9c7b26e4ffeqSUDmuHPylcNLD","part":{"partID":"prt_16385f32f002hQUdx6qLzUxBxW","sessionID":"ses_e9c7b26e4ffeqSUDmuHPylcNLD","messageID":"msg_16385c852001C2MIOWP7VuC94b","type":"tool","id":"call_00_MgBHsIpBVun314hLO8Eu1761","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /home/baptistefaisy/hackathon-memory && echo \"---LISTE---\" && .venv/bin/python scripts/historique_client.py liste 2>&1 | head -60 && echo \"---GET oom---\" && .venv/bin/python scripts/historique_client.py get \"oom\" 2>&1 | head -20 && echo \"---GET heap---\" && .venv/bin/python scripts/historique_client.py get \"heap\" 2>&1 | head -20 && echo \"---TROUVER memoire---\" && .venv/bin/python scripts/historique_client.py trouver \"memoire insuffisante JVM\" 2>&1 | head -30","timeout":120000},"output":"---LISTE---\n[2] Test — timeout de connexion PostgreSQL  (2026-10-22 07:53:12.267209+00:00)\n[1] Problème d'authentification PostgreSQL après recréation  (2026-10-22 07:47:06.701617+00:00)\n[1] Service Aiven recree : port PostgreSQL change  (2026-10-22 07:47:05.846651+00:00)\n[1] avn service cli psql echoue avec password authentication failed  (2026-10-22 07:47:04.881535+00:00)\n[1] Mot de passe PostgreSQL Aiven masque dans l'API  (2026-10-22 07:47:03.377109+00:00)\n---GET oom---\nNone\nNone\n---GET heap---\nNone\nNone\n---TROUVER memoire---\n(introuvable)\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"---LISTE---\n[2] Test — timeout de connexion PostgreSQL  (2026-10-22 07:53:12.267209+00:00)\n[1] Problème d'authentification PostgreSQL après recréation  (2026-10-22 07:47:06.701617+00:00)\n[1] Service Aiven recree : port PostgreSQL change  (2026-10-22 07:47:05.846651+00:00)\n[1] avn service cli psql echoue avec password authentication failed  (2026-10-22 07:47:04.881535+00:00)\n[1] Mot de passe PostgreSQL Aiven masque dans l'API  (2026-10-22 07:47:0